      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ASTON MACHINE (1) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 1.3 lengths at Sandown in a handy 29.81 beating Paw Xhani. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. The one to beat again. PAW ORENTHAL (8) was quickly into stride and raced on speed before drawing clear to a land a 2.5 lengths win (29.55) at Sandown in Grade 5. Is yet to find the frame here from three. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Significant danger. SPIRALLING (2) went down narrowly last time, finishing a head second behind Little Monkey in 30.17 and recording a new PB this course and distance. In form and looks a leading player again. ZIPPING MEHARY (3) was a surprise winner last time, cannot be ruled out.",
